  "about": "The bust bank: a person on a menu is a head, a top, facial hair and hair stacked on one canvas (src/bench/bust.ts is the only reader). Rounds 1 and 2 were painted by the CTO with Codex, Nov 7 to 9, 2026; round 3 (accepted by the owner Nov 10) replaced them: six heads, six tops, six hairstyles in four colors and, for men, a beard and a mustache in three, for each sex. See README.md for his rulings and tags.json for one row per file. New pieces keep the canvas and the order and are added as rows here. `people` are the people a bust can be, each with a skin tone; their ids are the ones a saved look names. `hairColors` says which painted hair colors an adult of each tone may have (who exists, never what anyone does); `olderHair` is the color an older head wears. `names` are the creator's words for a tone, a style and a color.",
